From cfd122b89ae8629a0957d23d191c97813f4ffe2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DSMO <dsmo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:22:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] DSMO: no hidden features' art, skills, widget or links
 before release
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

dsh-Go's brand and mascot art is not AGPL (ASSETS.md), and DSMO hides the
features that use it. Text changes only; native/apply.sh deletes the
binary files (so this patch doesn't carry them):

- page_links: hiddenPageLinks (tavern, companion, forum, community, pets,
  shared-links) are neither link targets nor pages, from a reply, from
  outside the app or from the page;
- the 伙伴小屋 and pet skills are no longer installed on each engine start;
- pubspec no longer declares assets/whale, assets/pets/*, assets/star and
  those two skills; the Star dialog draws no whale sticker;
- the 伙伴小屋 home-screen widget is gone (receiver, plugin, layout,
  strings, background).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
